Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): retain PR acceptance through GraphQL exhaustion
 [daveey]

GraphQL quota is shared with display pollers; exhaustion previously stranded delivered PR tasks while REST remained available. Fall back only on GitHub quota errors, retaining profile credentials, required context/app identities, complete exact-head evidence, merge-time cutoff and fresh PR head/state readback. Generic auth, local budget and incomplete REST policy reads remain fail closed. Regression: 11 acceptance consumer files pass, including an actual SQLite completion under injected GraphQL exhaustion and stale/failure controls.
